# Title: LSASS Process Reconnaissance Via Findstr.EXE
# ID: fe63010f-8823-4864-a96b-a7b4a0f7b929
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-08-12
# Tags: attack.credential-access, attack.t1552.006
# Description: Detects findstring commands that include the keyword lsass, which indicates recon actviity for the LSASS process PID
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog (((process_exec="*lsass*") AND (((process_path="*\\find.exe" OR process_path="*\\findstr.exe")) OR ((process_name="FIND.EXE" OR process_name="FINDSTR.EXE")))) OR ((process_exec="* /i \"lsass*" OR process_exec="* /i lsass.exe*" OR process_exec="*findstr \"lsass*" OR process_exec="*findstr lsass*" OR process_exec="*findstr.exe \"lsass*" OR process_exec="*findstr.exe lsass*")))
